-- check/good (project): the module §6.8 is about. It never writes the word
-- `Owner`, yet the type of `again` is `Owner.Token` — so `Owner` must still
-- be checked before it. There is no direct edge `User -> Owner`; the
-- guarantee is that `Owner` is an ANCESTOR (`User -> Middle -> Owner`),
-- because a module starts only once every dependency has FINISHED.
import Middle exposing (first)


pub again =
    first
